viously published. )>>endobj25 0 obj<</K 15/P 55 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Review Process: Each submission will undergo a double-blind peer review process.)>>endobj26 0 obj<</K 16/P 56 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(AI Policy: Generative AI tools should not be used to produce manuscript content. However, such tools may be utilized for editing, proofreading, or improving grammar and structural clarity.)>>endobj27 0 obj<</K 17/P 57 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(File Formats: Manuscripts should be submitted in Word \(.doc or .docx\) or PDF format.)>>endobj28 0 obj<</K 18/P 58 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Conflict of Interest Declaration: Authors must disclose any potential conflicts of interest at the time of submission.)>>endobj29 0 obj<</K 19/P 59 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Font Type and Size: The font should be times new roman and font size should be 12, line spacing should be 1.5.)>>endobj30 0 obj<</K 20/P 60 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Layout: Manuscripts should be prepared in a single-spaced, one-column portrait format to ensure readability and consistency.)>>endobj31 0 obj<</K 21/P 61 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Length: The recommended length of the manuscript is 6…8 pages \(within 3500 to 4000 words\), including references, tables, and figures.)>>endobj32 0 obj<</K 22/P 62 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Margins: Standard margins should be applied as follows: Top: 2.54 cm, Bottom: 2.54 cm, Left: 3.18 cm, and Right: 3.18 cm.)>>endobj33 0 obj<</K 23/P 63 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Page Numbers: All pages must include bottom-centered page numbering.)>>endobj34 0 obj<</K 24/P 64 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Manuscript Structure: The paper should be organized into the following sections: Title, Structured Abstract, Keywords, Main Text, and References.)>>endobj35 0 obj<</K 25/P 65 0 R/Pg 6 0 R/S/H3/T(Figures and Tables: All figures and tables must be high-resolution \(e.g., .ai, .eps, .jpeg, .bmp, or .tif\), sequentially numbered, and accompanied by clear, descriptive captions.)>>endobj36 0 obj<</K 26/P 66 0 R/Pg 6 0